From 8f72042d8d56a4b6207efd04b1798f2d497ce13f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:30:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s developer image: one image for every J714s (GPU bins
 from the ADT)

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora16.j714s3-3 adds linux-aurora-n1 0010 and
defaults to t6050-j714s-gpu-adt-simpledrm.dtb, whose GPU takes the
chip's voltage bins from the ADT instead of one unit's table.
m1n1-aurora 1.6.1.aurora22.j714s4 adds m1n1-installer 0005, which copies
those ADT properties into the gpu node. Both from betizzel/omarchy-m5
installer/recipes (3da5a934).
